# sysusers.d: the account voxctrl-server.service runs as. Installed by the
# voxctrl-server AUR package as /usr/lib/sysusers.d/voxctrl-server.conf.
# Its home holds the server's settings, certificate, models and clients' voices.
u voxctrl - "VoxCtrl speech server" /var/lib/voxctrl
# GPU device nodes (/dev/dri/renderD*) belong to these groups; without them a
# Vulkan build of the server runs on the CPU.
m voxctrl render
m voxctrl video
